==============================================================================
REAL-DATA RUN -- actual ten-ETF universe, 2007-04-11 onward
==============================================================================

Loaded 4892 trading days, 2007-04-12 to 2026-09-21, tickers: ['SPY', 'EFA', 'EEM', 'IEF', 'TLT', 'LQD', 'HYG', 'GLD', 'DBC', 'VNQ']
Open prices available -- rebalances execute at the next session's open per M2, not at the decision-day close.
Initial training window per M2's calendar: 1946 trading days through 2014-12-31

